            "review_title": "Review at Flambé",
            "review_text": "Tran K\n7 contributions\n0\nTop 1 bistro in Hanoi\nJun 2026 • Couples\nI had a wonderful dining experience at Flambé Hanoi. The concept is quite unique, especially if you have never tried Flammkuchen before. The food was fresh, flavorful, and beautifully presented. We ordered several dishes to share and every dish was enjoyable.\n\nThe atmosphere is warm, stylish, and perfect for both a date night and a gathering with friends. What impressed me most was the service – the staff were genuinely friendly, attentive, and happy to explain the menu and recommendations.\n\nThe location in Hanoi’s Old Quarter is also very convenient. It’s refreshing to find a restaurant that offers something different from the usual dining options in the area.\n\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for authentic European flavors, good wine, and a memorable dining experience in Hanoi. I will definitely come back on my next visit.\nRead more\nWritten June 7, 2026\nTrần Mai\nThank you so much for your heartfelt response! It truly made my day! Please come back next time we would love to have you again\nWritten July 3, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
